{"uid":"8ee32654305e8eb","name":"test_an_abruptly_killed_process_leaves_a_recoverable_record","fullName":"tests.test_events_webhooks#test_an_abruptly_killed_process_leaves_a_recoverable_record","historyId":"80b1b47a16c60ff5ab662e2fc8e9f5a4","time":{"start":1788295585570,"stop":1788295585618,"duration":48},"description":"The half of durability the graceful drain cannot cover.\n\n    ``stop()`` drains queued and in-flight events, but ``SIGKILL``, an OOM kill, and a\n    container eviction never run it — and both the queue and the in-flight map are memory\n    only. An operator could still not tell \"nothing happened\" from \"we failed to tell you\"\n    for precisely the failure where it matters most.\n\n    A killed process cannot be simulated by calling ``stop()``, because that is the path\n    under test being absent. So the crash is modelled the only faithful way: hold the\n    sender inside the POST so the event is genuinely accepted-but-unsettled, then abandon\n    the dispatcher without stopping it — leaving exactly the durable state a killed process\n    would leave — and start a fresh dispatcher against the same database.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The half of durability the graceful drain cannot cover.</p>\n<pre><code>``stop()`` drains queued and in-flight events, but ``SIGKILL``, an OOM kill, and a\ncontainer eviction never run it — and both the queue and the in-flight map are memory\nonly. An operator could still not tell &quot;nothing happened&quot; from &quot;we failed to tell you&quot;\nfor precisely the failure where it matters most.\n\nA killed process cannot be simulated by calling ``stop()``, because that is the path\nunder test being absent. So the crash is modelled the only faithful way: hold the\nsender inside the POST so the event is genuinely accepted-but-unsettled, then abandon\nthe dispatcher without stopping it — leaving exactly the durable state a killed process\nwould leave — and start a fresh dispatcher against the same database.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1788295196269,"stop":1788295196270,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1788295196270,"stop":1788295196271,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_asyncio_loop_factory","time":{"start":1788295293217,"stop":1788295293217,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_default_tests_to_trusted_header_auth","time":{"start":1788295585262,"stop":1788295585263,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1788295585262,"stop":1788295585262,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time":{"start":1788295585262,"stop":1788295585262,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_reset_tracer_singleton","time":{"start":1788295585263,"stop":1788295585263,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":